---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — OmniAI Studio" description="Contact OmniAI Studio about AI automation, document intelligence, AI agents, integrations, and custom intelligent systems." canonical="https://omniaistudio.in/contact">
<div class="page"><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h1 class="display">Have a workflow worth rebuilding?</h1><p class="lead">Tell OmniAI Studio what is repetitive, slow, error-prone, or difficult to scale. Official contact channels can be added before launch.</p><section class="section contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT INQUIRY</p><h2>Start with the problem.</h2><p class="muted">You do not need a perfect technical specification. Describe the current process, the tools involved, what you want to improve, and any constraints you already know.</p><form name="project-inquiry" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field"><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="project-inquiry" /><p class="hidden"><label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p><label>Name<input type="text" name="name" required /></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required /></label><label>What do you want to automate?<textarea name="message" rows="7" required></textarea></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Send inquiry ↗</button></form></div><aside class="contact-side"><div class="card"><span class="tag">EMAIL</span><h3>Official email</h3><p>Add the studio email in the CMS before launch.</p></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">SOCIAL</span><h3>Instagram / LinkedIn</h3><p>Add official profile links in Site Settings.</p></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">COMMUNITY</span><h3>Slack</h3><p>Add the preferred Slack contact when the workspace is ready.</p></div></aside></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:70px}.contact-grid h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,54px);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:18px 0}.muted{color:#7f899c;line-height:1.7;max-width:650px}form{display:grid;gap:18px;margin-top:35px}label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#a8b1c0}input,textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid #283141;border-radius:9px;background:#0b0f17;color:#f3f5f8;padding:13px;font:inherit;outline:none}input:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:#56657d}textarea{resize:vertical}.hidden{position:absolute;left:-9999px}.contact-side{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:12px}.contact-side .card h3{margin:22px 0 8px}.contact-side .card p{font-size:13px}@media(max-width:800px){.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}}
</style>
